'''Clonemask''' is a spell that allows a [[Seeker]] to create a mask of someone's face to wear as a disguise. 

==History==
The spell was used and tested by [[Klaus]]. {{source|TCG:OAL-088|OAL-088}}

[[Zhalia Moon]] used this spell off-screen in [[King Solomon's mines]] to create masks of a pair of [[Rassimov]]'s [[Suits]] for her and [[Dante Vale]] to wear as a disguise. Posing as the Suits, they led [[the Organization]] to another room, until [[the Professor]] figured out the decoy, to which Dante and Zhalia warned the rest of the team, removing their masks. {{source|To Be Together}}
